conversations = PackedStringArray("One drink.\nshrimp: what kind?\nSomething to keep me up: a dark shot from the machine. Something for the gains. And a splash of the salty sauce from home. Accelerated.", "The more you buy, the more you save.\nshrimp: that's not how a bar works.\nMy chips need power. A dark coffee shot, a muscle drink, and the salty sauce for my dumplings.")
